* Brand logos
  Provider logos are not bundled with this package: at run time the server
  reads magpie's own `plugin-providers.json` (the registry magpie maintains
  next to its usage.jsonl) and magpie's local `icons/` cache, keeping only
  icons already present on this machine. Remote-provider icon names come
  from the configured remote magpie's usage API when remote attribution is
  enabled; the image bytes still come from the local cache. No network
  image downloads and no plugin-directory scanning are involved. Product and
  company names and logos are trademarks or registered trademarks of their
  respective owners, used solely to identify the corresponding providers;
  they do not imply endorsement.
